年六十七建和三年卒李膺時為尚書自表師喪二縣皆為立祠有子八人儉緄靖燾汪爽肅專並有名稱時人謂八龍初荀氏舊里名西豪潁隂令渤海苑康以為昔髙陽氏有才子八人今荀氏亦有八子故改其里曰髙陽里靖有至行不仕年五十而終號曰𤣥行先生淑兄子昱字伯條曇字元智昱為沛相曇為廣陵太守兄弟皆正身疾惡志除閹官其支黨賔客有在二郡者纎罪必誅昱後共大將軍竇武謀誅中官與李膺俱死曇亦禁錮終身","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"start":0,"end":2,"surface":"荀淑","kind":"person","person_id":"yoo_ox0_545","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"既有節引同原行列位置，保持舊mention語義；由concordance去重。","id":"c-houhanshu-062-xunhan-zhongchen:xun-full:xunshu:m0000"},{"start":3,"end":5,"surface":"季和","kind":"person","person_id":"yoo_ox0_545","status":"contextual_provisional","candidate_person_ids":[],"interpretation_note":"完整本單元與跨篇候選核讀；原字保留。","id":"c-houhanshu-062-xunhan-zhongchen:xun-full:xunshu:m0003"},{"start":11,"end":13,"surface":"荀卿","kind":"person","person_id":"wuo_ghc_ajx","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"既有節引同原行列位置，保持舊mention語義；由concordance去重。","id":"c-houhanshu-062-xunhan-zhongchen:xun-full:xunshu:m0011"},{"start":39,"end":40,"surface":"其","kind":"person","person_id":"yoo_ox0_545","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整敘事限定片語：稱其知人；集體或未名不補身份。","id":"c-houhanshu-062-xunhan-zhongchen:xun-full:xunshu:m0039"},{"start":42,"end":44,"surface":"安帝","kind":"person","person_id":"7zd_hi5_fwe","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"既有節引同原行列位置，保持舊mention語義；由concordance去重。","id":"c-houhanshu-062-xunhan-zhongchen:xun-full:xunshu:m0042"},{"start":64,"end":66,"surface":"李固","kind":"person","person_id":"5h1_iqa_qfj","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"既有節引同原行列位置，保持舊mention語義；由concordance去重。","id":"c-houhanshu-062-xunhan-zhongchen:xun-full:xunshu:m0064"},{"start":66,"end":68,"surface":"李膺","kind":"person","person_id":"8qt_232_3b9","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"既有節引同原行列位置，保持舊mention語義；由concordance去重。","id":"c-houhanshu-062-xunhan-zhongchen:xun-full:xunshu:m0066"},{"start":72,"end":73,"surface":"之","kind":"person","person_id":"yoo_ox0_545","status":"contextual_provisional","interpret